  "id": "cornelia-de-lange-syndrome",
  "term": "Cornelia de Lange syndrome",
  "definition": "Cornelia de Lange syndrome is a rare genetic syndrome marked by low birth weight, slowed growth, behavioral problems, learning and intellectual impairment, and a characteristic facial appearance. Most cases are linked to changes in the NIPBL gene, while some milder forms are linked to changes in SMC1A or SMC3.",
